WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.659
MySQL va SQLite da UPSERT farqlari

00:13.659 --> 00:28.517
MySQL: ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE

00:28.517 --> 00:41.573
MySQL tuzoqlari: REPLACE va AUTO_INCREMENT

00:41.573 --> 00:53.209
SQLite: ON CONFLICT va bir nechta maqsad

00:53.209 --> 01:06.088
DML xatolari: REPLACE va WHERE true zarurati

01:06.088 --> 01:19.700
Xulosa
